            <div xml:id="m-cfec52a0-feef-4baa-82f4-b82d71671aa4">
              <lg xml:id="m-b39bd9cd-fc2b-4dce-b7b6-2fcd8030b656">
                <l xml:id="m-6e2b2aa8-6915-47b5-9d50-dbf41a14edb3" facs="#m-3180f4ba-1f6e-460d-9e21-9857bb0713f3" label="text-like">St. Stephen, The First Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-081ab3df-2c12-43a2-8bc7-71f98f39cf97" facs="#m-293d501a-12ec-4935-aa34-4e3305ac239b" label="ambiguous">417</l><l xml:id="m-1e9c4ffb-6ee6-416d-9b86-be2908f1b76c" facs="#m-76aeeb7c-1736-45ce-ab2f-78714168e549" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelil secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 23.</l><l xml:id="m-cc531022-2a9b-4fa2-b8a5-00ab9ce58c8a" facs="#m-e8d197c8-5138-4146-8567-dfeeedb17f48" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Dicébat Jesus altáre. Amen dico vobis, vénient</l><l xml:id="m-32f2f6bd-ea9c-4da9-9cdf-fe5b91cb2b3e" facs="#m-b550d36c-f604-45a0-8218-b8d648bf98c7" label="lyrics-like">L scribis et pharisaéis: Ecce ego</l><l xml:id="m-0c4bf2fe-34e9-4a2e-a764-07760755caeb" facs="#m-92d967bf-b514-4ad5-900f-9e2a18271bf8" label="lyrics-like">haec ómnia super generatiónem</l><l xml:id="m-ec8b64c7-779f-4c9e-b988-971d1ec94db9" facs="#m-74effd9a-f88e-4cf6-b3e9-a39b3378e137" label="lyrics-like">mitto ad vos prophétas, et sapién¬</l><l xml:id="m-5031b274-e986-487a-b6d2-daa6c9aa3a29" facs="#m-447baf7c-cffa-4a7e-a600-da0b2d05fd7f" label="lyrics-like">istam. Jerúsalem, Jerúsalem, quae</l><l xml:id="m-470d85dd-89cc-4fd3-8c5d-193d4c40b7f1" facs="#m-3134c60d-9d59-4da1-8e6c-1482ccaf5226" label="lyrics-like">tes, et scribas, et ex illis occidétis</l><l xml:id="m-cf2d47f3-d487-434f-b322-cfaa228e7a64" facs="#m-4ae4d717-ca8b-43f3-aa54-d82351d686b7" label="lyrics-like">occidis prophétas, et lápidas eos,</l><l xml:id="m-8699b518-378d-4913-9e71-bd862eeb5158" facs="#m-189eae49-15b3-4d0b-8d1d-fcfdb9f17d2b" label="lyrics-like">et crucifigétis, et ex eis flagellábitis</l><l xml:id="m-3c2a6d83-410f-4319-9c75-f68a346d4f3e" facs="#m-6999fd40-4dcf-4638-86a1-e45b535c38f0" label="lyrics-like">qui ad te missi sunt, quòties vólui</l><l xml:id="m-fe8fee4e-ecea-4cc4-82f7-8115fb3329dd" facs="#m-a7cac6c0-a802-4d5e-8612-cb787357eeda" label="lyrics-like">in synagógis vestris, et persequé¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a3a399d-e2f7-4179-b725-6073dbe37892" facs="#m-b8350cfa-de40-4f0f-9eac-8612c47575cd" label="lyrics-like">congregáre filios tuos, quemádmo¬</l><l xml:id="m-c511cfd0-5068-4ead-ba83-6a3468000e22" facs="#m-f5320565-cdbb-4e1c-98b0-d8984f70fd86" label="lyrics-like">mini de civitáte in civitátem: ut</l><l xml:id="m-d221a9b6-5c65-4946-a429-dfb48352a8d9" facs="#m-f6e46c8d-d37a-4272-bca1-7c1a45cea6fd" label="lyrics-like">dum gallína cóngregat pullos suos</l><l xml:id="m-79e4acad-d99c-4b06-ba4a-330a2d515578" facs="#m-8bba2e2d-7c96-41e2-87d2-b1a40ae16c9b" label="lyrics-like">véniat super vos omnis sanguis ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-ea503ab1-9639-4aa9-aba2-0241959d01f1" facs="#m-5ee5d5d2-5cab-4956-884c-e5fc6993126d" label="lyrics-like">sub alas, et noluisti ? Ecce relinqué¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c1a20ce-80f8-4252-a3e9-9a98a1ec2d6d" facs="#m-743d6211-b892-43a4-81d9-58e614c2004e" label="lyrics-like">tur vobis domus vestra desérta. Di¬</l><l xml:id="m-de84624b-dc6b-48c5-a60e-0b9207ceebe1" facs="#m-5603e06e-01be-417c-aa0e-e9fd145aa8d4" label="lyrics-like">stus, qui effúsus est super terram, a</l><l xml:id="m-a992df38-0a38-4a9f-8458-5bfbb7a624c1" facs="#m-eb6bd3c4-e4bb-4222-9bbf-7e2d631d6fd3" label="lyrics-like">sánguine Abel justi usque ad sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-3b357cd2-a892-46af-9c58-96aabad36af0" facs="#m-86482193-3a1d-4dcd-8f4d-e7ca0baf2f09" label="lyrics-like">co enim vobis, non me vidébitis</l><l xml:id="m-94a3004f-8657-452d-b6ea-183f9741c61b" facs="#m-f50357c3-b6bc-43eb-8b3d-834dca756811" label="lyrics-like">guinem Zachariae, filii Barachíae,</l><l xml:id="m-cdb84afa-c87b-4859-a155-5ad77e54d22c" facs="#m-56265543-4b49-446e-9a41-2c27b49f2206" label="lyrics-like">ámodo, donec dicátis : Benedictus,</l><l xml:id="m-dfe176d1-6a5e-4265-8174-ee2d0051ba4b" facs="#m-afa3295d-7584-4868-a5b3-88226dda6a09" label="lyrics-like">quem occidistis inter templum et qui venit in nómine Dómini. Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-c6b50e5f-c060-4f16-840f-6e6150f4bb12" facs="#m-68820e36-6efe-4d6c-bb57-72c704bf7877" label="ambiguous">orert.!</l><l xml:id="m-e700d8cf-fa90-436b-afd7-0641582d474f" facs="#m-2c2a0e04-ae5d-4165-ac21-d7a27249b8f3" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-8d8e0034-f9f7-4d24-82a6-19a358c83af6" facs="#m-9b535136-295d-4850-afd4-69a6df057b25" label="lyrics-like">Stépha¬</l><l xml:id="m-61f6b224-625c-4145-8f91-8d61fa3999b2" facs="#m-82ca956e-0a3b-4b6a-b46e-ce18e7b56174" label="lyrics-like">runt “Apó¬ sto-li</l><l xml:id="m-62af3338-56ab-47be-b5df-17560fb9d001" facs="#m-388764b7-5710-41a2-a3fd-3d355fb99a2e" label="lyrics-like">A-legé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ee3d769-c2cd-47e4-83d4-d98244be8a4b" facs="#m-2f9ca5c7-4d80-4837-b719-66b5c146d8fb" label="lyrics-like">num fí¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a2d558d-6465-4765-8ebf-29b37c87ca51" facs="#m-9cbad206-c665-445b-bbd6-4f3b0be77f8c" label="lyrics-like">num le¬ ví- tam, plé¬</l><l xml:id="m-cf3e0612-92b9-4b54-8c34-3f9c59247c90" facs="#m-18e8ffd7-d5ef-4b1c-994e-a4f9be7b5b07" label="ambiguous">de et</l><l xml:id="m-b5650188-147a-41c9-8915-6d7fb3213097" facs="#m-6feb09c2-d855-401c-ab81-2cec3be2ec54" label="lyrics-like">lapidavé¬</l><l xml:id="m-acfa216f-ecd9-4261-9a00-fa5d82c63938" facs="#m-9129e8f0-2123-402a-b16f-8f32b80f622f" label="lyrics-like">Spí¬ ri-tu Sáncto: quem</l><l xml:id="m-a58f6bf8-d0e7-4156-803c-6fb723e0c355" facs="#m-b635e70d-55c6-4a8b-a9d4-b89b9768c342" label="lyrics-like">runt Judaé- orántem, et di- céntem: Dó-mi-ne</l><l xml:id="m-bf9e7e10-097e-4361-988a-913f93b55c80" facs="#m-fda49ca3-3a1c-4408-9d3b-24ddd10ff11a" label="lyrics-like">spí-ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-2362fd59-5782-4d9d-b72e-fc07952868d5" facs="#m-a976e195-fd54-47d3-94e1-f932c1c104ae" label="lyrics-like">tum mé¬ um,</l><l xml:id="m-9352047f-b9fd-41ca-b1e0-da9a83945f86" facs="#m-392959ca-e1f4-4812-97e5-14d9dace8a44" label="lyrics-like">Jé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5948d632-53d7-47ed-86d1-98e52c7ee3d7" facs="#m-26759f85-dc35-4c8c-82f7-9bb154b774dd" label="lyrics-like">su, ác- ci-pe</l><l xml:id="m-b8a63a9d-13bc-45d2-a4fb-aa995ee86e0e" facs="#m-94930884-3ffc-402f-bf48-49a337799d79" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-9489e2e7-1d9e-462e-b4a6-d9a90178f0b8" facs="#m-91633712-4917-4a41-bcfe-648560ad747b" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-e14666f5-46a9-4517-9308-b009c0bf8311" facs="#m-0a454d15-46f1-45e8-a113-71597a57e7d4" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-54754351-0b8a-434f-8d7c-85eb706c67e0" facs="#m-efb0bf02-9974-4779-a11f-117d71facead" label="lyrics-like">QUscipe Dómine múnera pro tuó¬ effécit : ita nos devótio reddat innó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee6c03a0-bbdd-4580-b93f-898a99cb2221" facs="#m-532885c8-02a3-4476-aa8b-7c0de476c339" label="lyrics-like">O rum commemoratióne sanctó- cuos. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-76ba007d-f311-40b5-9408-98a7d88d7266" facs="#m-2991d75e-76b1-49a8-9e81-e41d2d5ac8d0" label="lyrics-like">rum : ut, sicut illos pássio gloriósos</l><l xml:id="m-3d93b2e6-ea12-47c7-9616-a10c8c9edd3e" facs="#m-4bcdcec7-dadd-45f3-9e3c-f814285cb67b" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of the Nativity. Secret. Obláta Dómine. p. 410.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>